# BGSAVE (B-25): the replies, not the file — the file is BackgroundSaveTest's and bench/fork/bgsave.sh's.
# A second BGSAVE while the first runs would race each server's child against the next command, so
# "already in progress" is held by BackgroundSaveTest, which sends both in one pipeline.
BGSAVE now
BGSAVE SCHEDULE x
BGSAVE a b
BGSAVE
